5246.jpeg/npI7IPEW7Dtm3EDMhPdyiHt7lMHQA0ZDMOWvqjDlr6o\"/><figcaption>林志玲（Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109068976164864712409.jpeg/hjzqYe5rnb1H9_UzG7ntJPWzzVx9M7uGxCQq6MQkKug\"/><figcaption>林志玲（Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109066602057728789214.jpeg/7ElUYbim1saEBxutGyNhqMSiEuuvCKJeBLe5iAS3uYg\"/><figcaption>林志玲（Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225227833020416659813.png/oU2RTho1H4_4BnI09gT9sbBLgpvsqvXGeOJ-gnjifoI\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224536166400672315.png/j6Wldulnoy8E90w05hSerFcSMKKneUis7FGzPuxRsz4\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224024461312562914.png/4eJqpFtYt7p4gwNM8jaUODWE6u7TIQ9VtjnDfrY5w34\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225227254206464724180.png/Y4uKb-zOK3VNdXPnKImjw-pIezQr9w4Kb3IsFW9yLBU\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224460668928271348.png/Vt6DAeO1lg6P2T7_Q8du6m4aY0A0NqUDRtHkakbR5Go\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225219607597056415962.png/ZFZms7OIVinGybM6_omc2Y3O3M8SvSMenpE7y56RO8s\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225221709074432058624.png/RF2H7xnch8xdua02Si4rg0SzMp-R33iar8RGta_ERrU\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224095895552208461.png/1iC0g1QTpx9zceog6IMTjgfP2x-o3V-eaw9L3msPS94\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225230274236416726890.png/4s6rkOs7_7-HRg-_EqduroHLOmW0BQyiK3j8dCt4_HQ\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225226797158400250684.png/2mdVgB1Bh4MOolpfGCeY17UB6REWg0jT_x4vhP8eL4Q\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225227849797632894235.png/11fgRfkHysv3Gu2CgVSgVVoDWnBj8jngIdiCAiHYggI\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225230634946560249013.png/wlwiyAJCL3E-85zlPRbeS75aKXBZ0bt5RbNJ0UWzSdE\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><p>照片中，雖然林志玲在兒子的眼部用墨鏡圖案特效遮住，但眼部以下的面容卻一覽無遺，即使被墨鏡特效遮住了眼睛，也擋不住帥氣的顏值，完全神複製父母的完美基因。</p><p>看著孩子的懂事與貼心，林志玲也體悟道：</p><figure><img alt=\"女神林志玲也在Facebook發文分享溫馨日常，曬出帶兒子去農場玩樂的近照。（Facebook@林志玲Chiling Lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163068170106310656385904.png/bjd-xnu25invtGCl6ObHR9iD6gtQfyp_eNqJZnjaiWY\"/><figcaption>女神林志玲也在Facebook發文分享溫馨日常，曬出帶兒子去農場玩樂的近照。（Facebook@林志玲Chiling Lin）</figcaption></figure><p>字裏行間滿是對家庭的甜蜜與滿足。貼文一出，吸引大批網友留言獻上祝福，紛紛直呼：</p><p>「太有愛了」</p><p>「幸福的一家人，父親節快樂」</p><p>「就算遮住，也能感覺兒子很帥」</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：林志玲疑遭內地封殺　央視新劇客串被除名　綜藝預告急下架惹揣測】林志玲參加陸綜《毛雪汪》，集數臨時被撤換成譚松韻與董晴。（微博@毛雪汪不是毛血旺）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135905693342109696137548.jpeg/4lAOMg07vNQdm1tC5HNGKLw17ZYUwuqB1E_0p9RP9Kc\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：林志玲疑遭內地封殺　央視新劇客串被除名　綜藝預告急下架惹揣測】林志玲參加陸綜《毛雪汪》，集數臨時被撤換成譚松韻與董晴。（微博@毛雪汪不是毛血旺）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲參加陸綜《毛雪汪》，集數臨時被撤換成譚松韻與董晴。（微博@毛雪汪不是毛血旺）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135905695821074432287359.jpeg/6m9zb-FEvov3_niRe74DG-Hz0p0ndDUlnAfTFJwH0xQ\"/><figcaption>林志玲參加陸綜《毛雪汪》，集數臨時被撤換成譚松韻與董晴。（微博@毛雪汪不是毛血旺）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲受邀客串的央視陸劇《玉蘭花開君再來》，在昨日舉行的演員陣容官宣中，不僅未列入其名字，劇組對於演員名單的變動也未多做說明。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135905822895771648970483.jpeg/KLucljtpWQv-cwPDXiLL3G6cdOJWPns0IU48OiFOPDo\"/><figcaption>林志玲受邀客串的央視陸劇《玉蘭花開君再來》，在昨日舉行的演員陣容官宣中，不僅未列入其名字，劇組對於演員名單的變動也未多做說明。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲婉拒台灣文策院職位。（Facebook@林志玲 Chiling Lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135906558689939456917648.jpeg/epXNqWHRYEn5eD1VQ8wvZPtsmkWUeHrLa-f5ZWvn-WU\"/><figcaption>林志玲婉拒台灣文策院職位。（Facebook@林志玲 Chiling Lin）</figcaption></figure><p>謝金燕父親節發文…「原本打一堆字」卻刪掉　分享豬哥亮歌廳秀歌曲懷念</p><p>練HYROX練到雙手全是繭！夏和熙拍戲不能拍特寫</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T08:54:34.110037+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1359,"images":35,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}